@guide H_41_SearingGorge
@name Searing Gorge (47-48)
@faction Horde
@levels 47-48
@zone Searing Gorge
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Searing Gorge, visit 1 of 1 on the Horde route, levels 47-48.
@next H_42_SwampofSorrows

travel Searing Gorge
note Alliance: fly to Thelsamar, ride south into the Badlands and west past Kargath (Horde town) into the Searing Gorge. Horde: fly to Kargath and ride west. Thorium Point is in the north-west of the Gorge. Most quests here need level 45.
fp Thorium Point
